{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fantasy Creature Jigsaws</i> features 50 beautiful puzzles themed around 10 categories of creatures Dragons, Goblins, Manticores, Vampires, Unicorns, Elves, Sea Monsters, Dwarfs, Fairies, and the Undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is timed, offering an engaging experience as you race against the clock, earning Bronze, Silver or Gold Medals for beating par times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles get larger as you progress within each category adding to the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your skills further with the addition of hard mode which removes the puzzle outline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements for every puzzle you complete and use cloud saves to effortlessly transfer your progress between devices. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880820/extras/b08f11865a81d451c805c638c1d8669f.avif?t=1757309489\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the magical world of fantasy creatures and test your puzzle-solving skills!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dragon 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880820/b60a54c0ae61b3247c7f2dc5ff6a15fc09d6ad45.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880820/2cecd37611fb33bdf5fc4237962a825dfe6d9ed8.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880820/ea2ea8ce3c891ba4ca9111bb45b9827c4db48707.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880820/4c896d5f2d5f3e22830073dd4582b88762f3415b.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni